What's new in this Version:

* Apps shipped as extracted AppImages run without the ptrace tier, which stopped them on every signal they handle, set PROOT_NO_PTRACE=0 to restore it
* Install, update, remove, and uninstall signal KDE to refresh its icon cache so app icons show up without logging out
* Eden, Cemu, and Dolphin are no longer built from source and use the upstream AppImage releases
* New apps: MailCraft, Motrix, xbased
* Rebase RustConn to Resolute to fix a startup segfault on Wayland compositors with GPU passthrough
* Fix the Nextcloud icon and run OrcaSlicer with the X11 backend
